  "prefLabel": "Rev 401.10 Entitled applicant",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 401.10 “Entitled applicant” means an eligible person who applied for a property tax credit, exemption, or deferral in the approved manner.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 400) #9309, eff 10-30-08 (from Rev 401.05); ss by #12027, eff 10-28-16; renumbered by #12925 (formerly Rev 401.09)",
